<title>USA: Orbit International Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Orbit International Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter Ended    Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			     Sept. 30,		  Sept. 30,</p>
<p>			  1996	    1995	1996	  1995</p>
<p>Sales	    $ 4,798	 $ 1,851     $12,568	$10,026</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) from</p>
